      }
    },
    {
      "number": 23,
      "arab": "وَجِا۟ىٓءَ يَوْمَئِذٍۭ بِجَهَنَّمَ ۚ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ يَتَذَكَّرُ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ وَأَنَّىٰ لَهُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰ",
      "arab_kemenag": "وَجِايْۤءَ يَوْمَىِٕذٍۢ بِجَهَنَّمَۙ يَوْمَىِٕذٍ يَّتَذَكَّرُ الْاِنْسَانُ وَاَنّٰى لَهُ الذِّكْرٰىۗ",
      "latin": "Wa jī'a yauma'iżim bijahannam(a), yauma'iżiy yatażakkarul-insānu wa annā lahuż-żikrā.",
      "translation_id": "dan pada hari itu (neraka) Jahanam didatangkan, sadarlah manusia pada hari itu juga. Akan tetapi, bagaimana bisa kesadaran itu bermanfaat baginya?",
      "translation_en": "And brought [within view], that Day, is Hell - that Day, man will remember, but what good to him will be the remembrance?",
      "audio": {
        "01": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdullah-Al-Juhany/089023.mp3",
