        "06": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Yasser-Al-Dosari/089023.mp3"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 24,
      "arab": "يَقُولُ يَٰلَيْتَنِى قَدَّمْتُ لِحَيَاتِى",
      "arab_kemenag": "يَقُوْلُ يٰلَيْتَنِيْ قَدَّمْتُ لِحَيَاتِيْۚ",
      "latin": "Yaqūlu yā laitanī qaddamtu liḥayātī.",
      "translation_id": "Dia berkata, “Oh, seandainya dahulu aku mengerjakan (kebajikan) untuk hidupku ini!”",
      "translation_en": "He will say, \"Oh, I wish I had sent ahead [some good] for my life.\"",
      "audio": {
